OL,5,G1600 Composer of the Week: Clara
OL,6,G     Schumann and her Circle
OL,7,     F5/5. Donald Macleod meets the
OL,8,     Ffriends (and foes) of composer
OL,9,     FClara Schumann. Today, we explore
OL,10,     Fthe women who are often erased
OL,11,     Ffrom Clara's life story.
OL,12,G1700 In Tune
OL,13,     FItzhak Perlman on his new album
OL,14,     Ffeaturing the voice of Ella
OL,15,     FFitzgerald. Live music from the
OL,16,     Fcast of folk musical Franz and
OL,17,     FMarie.
